---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Terms of Service — Simba & Good" description="The terms that govern your use of Simba & Good.">
  <main class="doc"><div class="narrow">
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: [EFFECTIVE DATE]</p>

    <div class="legal-note"><strong>Template notice:</strong> This is a starting draft. Have it reviewed by a lawyer for your jurisdiction and Apple's requirements, and complete every [BRACKETED] field before publishing.</div>

    <p>These terms govern your use of the Simba &amp; Good website and app (the "Service"), provided by [LEGAL ENTITY NAME]. By using the Service, you agree to them.</p>

    <h2>The Service</h2>
    <p>Simba &amp; Good helps you care for your pet with breed- and age-aware guidance, reminders, and records.</p>

    <div class="highlight"><strong>Not veterinary advice.</strong> The Service provides general guidance only and is not a substitute for professional veterinary care. Always consult a qualified veterinarian about your pet's health. In an emergency, contact a vet immediately.</div>

    <h2>Subscriptions and billing</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Paid plans are sold as auto-renewing subscriptions through Apple. Your subscription begins after any free trial.</li>
      <li>Payment is charged to your Apple ID. Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the period ends.</li>
      <li>Manage or cancel your subscription in your Apple ID settings. Any unused portion of a free trial is forfeited when you purchase a subscription.</li>
      <li>Prices may change; we will give notice as required.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Our giving commitment</h2>
    <div class="highlight"><strong>Your subscription is not a donation.</strong> You are purchasing a subscription to the Service. Simba &amp; Good, as a business, commits to giving to animal welfare from its own revenue. Amounts you pay are not charitable donations by you and are not tax-deductible to you. Our welfare-giving goals are aspirational and described on our welfare plan page.</div>

    <h2>Partner offers</h2>
    <p>We may show optional, clearly labelled offers from partner brands. Featured partners contribute to animal welfare. Any transaction you enter with a partner is between you and that partner.</p>

    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>You agree not to misuse the Service, interfere with its operation, or use it unlawfully.</p>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>The Service, including its content and design, belongs to [LEGAL ENTITY NAME]. The information you add about your pet remains yours; you grant us the licence needed to operate the Service for you.</p>

    <h2>Disclaimers and liability</h2>
    <p>The Service is provided "as is". To the fullest extent permitted by law, we exclude implied warranties and are not liable for indirect or consequential loss. Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be limited by law.</p>

    <h2>Termination</h2>
    <p>You may stop using the Service at any time. We may suspend or end access if these terms are breached.</p>

    <h2>Governing law</h2>
    <p>These terms are governed by the laws of [JURISDICTION], and disputes are subject to the courts of [JURISDICTION].</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms and will post the updated version here.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p><a href="mailto:[CONTACT EMAIL]">[CONTACT EMAIL]</a>, [LEGAL ENTITY NAME], [REGISTERED ADDRESS].</p>
  </div></main>

  <style>
    .doc{padding:56px 0 80px}
    .narrow{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
    .doc h1{font-size:clamp(32px,4.6vw,46px);margin:14px 0 8px}
    .updated{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-bottom:28px}
    .legal-note{background:var(--sage);border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:36px}
    .doc h2{font-size:22px;margin:36px 0 10px}
    .doc p,.doc li{color:#37423b;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65}
    .doc ul{padding-left:20px}
    .doc li{margin:6px 0}
    .highlight{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid var(--gold);border-radius:10px;padding:16px 20px;margin:14px 0}
  </style>
</Base>
